messages.body:
After @DDdxx666 agreed to consider renaming the free MIT fork to avoid confusion:

"Not consider. Do it right now or I'm going to contact GitHub and have your account taken down."

@DDdxx666 complied within 30 minutes (renaming to `Stardust` and removing all T3 branding). @theo apologized privately in DMs while keeping both 200k-view public attack posts live.
